      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The area receives about 42 inches of rain annually and roughly 20 inches of snowfall each year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.fmowners.com/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Nestled in the Sierra Nevada foothills, Forest Meadows is close to Stanislaus National Forest, where residents enjoy hiking, camping, and fishing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
